{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302450","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302450","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130245001:1":{"text":"あの新しい氏族？武闘場で他の人が話してるのを聞いたよ。","source_cn":"是那个新氏族吗？我在武斗场听别人提到过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1F47B13F5FDDBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130245002:1":{"text":"他の氏族から捨てられたババリアの子どもたちばかりがいる氏族だって……","source_cn":"听说那里都是别的氏族遗弃的小蛮血……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CBD28B6452B1B94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130245003:1":{"text":"薦めてくれてありがとう。そこなら僕と妹も受け入れてもらえるかもね。","source_cn":"你提醒了我，那里或许真的适合我和妹妹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA240491CE33A8D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血约恩":{"text":"ババリアのヨアン","source":"小蛮血约恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}